A||||53||sloth85GT||You'd never guess what I saw today!||||10||
Z||000000||sloth85GT||08-15-2001||09:55 PM||||Okay, this is the scenario here, I was driving down portage going to my girlfriends place today. Just going about 55 takin it slow, and I look out of my passenger window and I see this little silver car, about as high as my GT, about the same shape, only not as curvy, pass me. <P>I was thinking........could it be? Yes, yes it is. That's a DMC logo on the front grill! The car was a Delorean!!! <P>I LOVE those cars, they may be wimpy and poorly constructed, but I've never seen one in person. This car looked so amazing! It's so rare! I'd glady trade my Fiero for a Delorean. Those cars are the coolest things on earth!<P>I just thought I'd like to share that with everyone. <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.mts.net/~kuzma/fieronl.gif">  <BR>Dan<BR>1985 Silver GT<P>WITH THE NEW WHEELS!!!!! WOOHOO!!!!!!||||reg||10
Z||000001||JSocha||08-15-2001||10:10 PM||||Blasphemy!<P>Burn at the stake like the heretic you are you shall!<P>Burn! Burn! Burn I say for such blasphemy!<P>You are Satan's messenger of eviel!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||10
Z||000002||btoth||08-15-2001||10:13 PM||||I just saw one today while I was out driving around.  They are very cool cars.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||10
Z||000003||Cheever2||08-15-2001||10:48 PM||||Soon as I finish this roll of film, I'll post the pics I took at last weekend's DMC World Headquarters open house.  There were maybe 20 to 25 DeLoreans there, and about 40 people.  The event was horribly organized; in fact, nothing was announced at all, until I finally left out of sheer boredom.  Just people standing around.  At least me & my boys got some free cold sodas & bottled spring water out of it.  Almost every car desperately needed some cosmetic repair.  The nice ones were displayed by the shop, not by the attendees.  The design of the car is just brilliant however, IMO.  More when I get the pics.<P>No, you sure don't see them on the road much anymore.  I remember a forum member posting about his DeLorean last year... anybody remember who that was?<P>* * *<BR>Crap!  I used my old name out of habit.<BR>Cliff, puh-lease put the brakes on that username when you get the time, thanks.<BR>* * *<P><BR><p>[This message has been edited by Cheever2 (edited 08-15-2001).]||||reg||6
Z||000004||btoth||08-15-2001||11:31 PM||||There are 3 that live in this area. Never saw any last year, but now I see them all the time.  Still very cool... it always takes me a minute to figure out what it is from head on.  <P>"What's that?  Looks really low and wide... silver too.  Oh, DeLorean! Cool!"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||7
